        "created_at": "2020-06-05T23:24:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't think I'd craft custom abilities unless you really wanted to get a specific flavor that a player might cry foul about.</p>\n<p>Could you explain how you imagine the abilities you chose work in terms of fluff and why you think they don't work?</p>",
