      {
        "id": 230906,
        "name": "powertrout",
        "username": "powertrout",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/8e7dd6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-06-06T04:52:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A specific flavor is what I want but I don't see any other villain abilities that invoke minor twists. Plenty that reference overcome and environment related twists.&nbsp;She's a relatively minor villain, so I don't want to make her crazy difficult to deal with in the process of breaking precedent.</p>\n<p>The abilities I have are fine, but the only power that's used by an ability is&nbsp;\"Psychic Feedback\". Illusions, Suggestion and Telepathy are sorta related to her core ability but were thrown in 'cause I needed to choose four. I might swap them out for Presence and a couple mobility powers to make her a little less one-note.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:06:01.669Z",
