        "raw": "<p>A specific flavor is what I want but I don't see any other villain abilities that invoke minor twists. Plenty that reference overcome and environment related twists.&nbsp;She's a relatively minor villain, so I don't want to make her crazy difficult to deal with in the process of breaking precedent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The abilities I have are fine, but the only power that's used by an ability is&nbsp;\"Psychic Feedback\". Illusions, Suggestion and Telepathy are sorta related to her core ability but were thrown in 'cause I needed to choose four. I might swap them out for Presence and a couple mobility powers to make her a little less one-note.</p>",
