        "created_at": "2020-06-06T12:10:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Actually, building a custom environment for a particular villain encounter is a really cool idea.&nbsp; Unfortunately, if it's a minor villain, it might not be worth the effort.</p>\n<p>Otherwise, you could give the villain lots of abilities to generate Boosts and Hinders and just define them as environmental effects.</p>",
